  "details": "**Feature:**\n\n- A new exposed parameter that is set to true when a VR Dashboard/Overlay such as SteamVR or Meta/Oculus Dashboard is open\n\n- Separate from the AFK parameter which is currently set to true when Overlays are open\n\n**Reason:**\n\n- Makes it possible to visually indicate on your avatar when a VR Overlay is open, so that others can know at a glance that you might not be fully paying attention\n\n- Having the overlay trigger the AFK parameter causes some avatars to do certain animations that make perfect sense for if they take their headset off, but do not make any sense for simply \"tabbing out\" into the overlay (Dissolving, emote-style animations, etc)\n\n**Optional Addition:**\n\n- Perhaps the ability to have this parameter also react to the VRChat window not being focused (for overlay animations to be able to play on desktop users avatars when they tab to another window for example)",
